#: desc: HTML output with attributes (bold, italic, underline, strike), custom theme
-v OUTPUT_FORMAT=html -v COLOR_ATTENTION=1 -v COLOR_SECTION=3 -v COLOR_DEPRECATED=4 -v COLOR_BACKTICKS=9 -v EXPORT_THEME=FG:000000,BG:AAAAAA,34:7c3f00 test/fixtures/Makefile.formats
#: stdout
<style>
  .makefile-doc-attention { font-weight: bold; }
  .makefile-doc-section { font-style: italic; }
  .makefile-doc-deprecated { text-decoration: underline; }
  .makefile-doc-default { color: #7c3f00; }
  .makefile-doc-backticks { text-decoration: line-through; }
  .makefile-doc { color: #000000; }
  .makefile-doc { background-color: #AAAAAA; }
</style>
<div class="makefile-doc">
<pre>
-----------------------
Available targets:
-----------------------
<span class="makefile-doc-section">
 Section with <span class="makefile-doc-backticks">backticks</span> and {braces}
</span>
<span class="makefile-doc-default">t-default   </span>   A default target with <span class="makefile-doc-backticks">backticks</span> and {braces}
               on two lines
<span class="makefile-doc-attention">t-attention </span>   An attention target
<span class="makefile-doc-deprecated">t-deprecated</span>   A deprecated target

-----------------------
Command-line arguments:
-----------------------
<span class="makefile-doc-default">VAR         </span>   A variable
-----------------------
</pre>
</div>
